@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
title 유지형 요청과 2초 명령 지속 시간

binary "run_request" as R
binary "run (확정됨)" as S
binary "drive" as D

@0
R is low
S is low
D is low

@1
R is high
S is high
D is high

@3
D is low
note bottom of D : 기한 도달;\n요청은 여전히 true

@5
R is low
S is low

@6
R is high
S is high
D is high

@8
D is low

D@1 <-> @3 : 2초
D@6 <-> @8 : 새 2초
@enduml
